TEXT -448 -176 Left 2 ;DG413 PANEL MUX  --  shared 6-pin port routed to Panel 1 (Mode 1) or Panel 2 (Mode 2)
TEXT -448 -144 Left 2 ;DG413 modelled as 2 NC + 2 NO switches on one select.  sel=0 -> NC on (Panel 1) ;  sel=1 -> NO on (Panel 2)
TEXT -448 -112 Left 2 ;Only X+/Y+ are switched ; X-/Y- are common (X- = 0 here = read-X phase).  Idle panel's + lines are open -> inert.
